<p>The kits behind these live with the system (Pixelmator, Final Cut, KineMaster). Every photo in them is free to use; the words are placeholders. Pick a style, then make it with the <a href="/concept/mobile/">phone guide</a> or the <a href="/concept/assets/">assets</a>.</p>
<h2 id="youtube-thumbnails">YouTube thumbnails</h2>
<p>The 67 Pixelmator thumbnails, by series — every layout the kit has: full frame, handwritten, triptych, viewfinder, polaroid, bento, thick-thin, matrix, tint, cinematic slate, templates.</p>
